UPDATE characters SET data = '{"slug":"shy-guy","name":"Shy Guy","team":"minion","ability":"Each night*, choose a player who chose you with their ability since yesterday: they die. You might register as the Demon.","creator":"legitch","appearsIn":"SCP Fragmented Veil","lede":"The Shy Guy (SCP-096) is an unstoppable docile humanoid that has omniscient awareness of who looked at it''s face, and kills them.","summaryBullets":["Each night, when a player chooses the Shy Guy with their ability since when they last woke, they''ll be a potential candidate to be killed the next night.","The Shy-Guy wakes each night except the first to learn all who did, then picks who dies for doing so.","Additionally, the Shy Guy might register as a Demon instead of a Minion at any time."],"howToRun":["If a player chooses to use their ability on the Shy Guy, this player is marked for death - mark them with the **LOOKED** reminder.","Each night, if any player is marked with the Shy Guy''s **LOOKED** reminder, wake the Shy Guy. Point to each player marked with the **LOOKED** reminder. They point at one of those players. Put the Shy Guy to sleep. The chosen player {{i|dies}} - mark them with the **DEAD** reminder. Eitherway, if the Shy-Guy woke or not, remove all current **LOOKED** reminder tokens on all players.","Each time the Recluse is targeted by an ability that detects or affects the Demon, choose if the Recluse registers as the Demon or not. Do whatever is appropriate, such as showing a Demon character token, nodding, giving finger signals, or allowing an ability to work that would normally only affect Demon players."],"quote":"[An unfortunate photobomb.](https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/incident-096-1-a/fourpixels.png)","iconBy":"le_nuberto","jinxes":[{"name":"Alchemist","align":"good","text":"If the Alchemist has the Shy-Guy ability, they don''t learn who chose them at night, and they choose a player each night*. Unless they chose the Alchemist with their ability last night, they don''t die.","id":"alchemist"},{"name":"Plague Doctor","align":"good","text":"If the Plague Doctor dies, a living Minion gains the Shy Guy''s ability in addition to their own ability, and learns this.","id":"plaguedoctor"}],"customBoxes":[{"title":"Alternative JSON & How to Run (Older)","content":"If you feel like you want a more lore-accurate Shy-Guy (SCP-096) with a slower wind up but immortality to almost everything, use this JSON.\n\nWhile preparing the first night, put the Shy Guy''s CRYING reminder token by their character token.\n\nEach dusk, if any player is marked with the Shy Guy''s LOOKED reminder, the Shy Guy will not mark new players - remove the Shy Guy''s CRYING reminder. Else if that''s not the case, put the Shy Guy''s CRYING reminder token by their character token.\n\nIf a good player chooses to use their ability on the Shy Guy whilst the Shy Guy is marked with the CRYING reminder, this player is marked for death - mark them with the LOOKED reminder.\n\nEach night, if any player is marked with the Shy Guy''s LOOKED reminder, wake the Shy Guy. Point to each player marked with the LOOKED reminder. They point at one of those players. Put the Shy Guy to sleep. The chosen player dies - mark them with the DEAD reminder.\n\nIf the Shy Guy would die to anything but the Demon''s ability: they remain alive (but they die if they are drunk or poisoned). If nominated & executed, declare that the player was executed but remains alive (do not say why.)\n\n**Shy Guy ' || char(9608) || '~** (Minion)\nEach night*, choose a good player who chose you with their ability the previous night if you weren''t killing: they die. You can only die to the Demon.\n\n**Other nights:** If a good player chose the Shy Guy with their ability the previous night and the Shy Guy is not killing today: Point to each player that did, the Shy Guy points to one of them. That player dies.\n**Reminders:** Crying, Looked, Looked, Looked, Looked, Looked, Dead\n**Credit:** Ability: @legitch. Image: @le_nuberto\n\n**Jinxes:**\nAlchemist: If the Alchemist has the Shy-Guy ability, they don''t learn who chose them at night, and they choose a player each night*. Unless they chose the Alchemist with their ability last night and they weren''t killing, they don''t die.\nLil'' Monsta: The Shy Guy can die by execution if they are babysitting Lil'' Monsta.\nPlague Doctor: If the Plague Doctor dies, a living Minion gains the Shy Guy''s ability in addition to their own ability, and learns this.\nKukalpa: The Shy Guy can die by execution if they are \"the Demon\".\nEyeceue: If the Eyeceue is active, the Shy Guy is always the last player to be ''the Demon'' and can die whilst that happens."}],"firstNight":0,"otherNight":53.096,"reminders":["Looked","Looked","Looked","Looked","Looked","Dead"],"setup":false,"otherNightReminder":"If a player chose the Shy Guy with their ability the previous night: Point to each player that did, the Shy Guy points to one of them. That player dies.","art":"art/shy-guy.png","jsonId":"shyguy_scp_fragmented_veil","curata":false}' WHERE slug='shy-guy';
